<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Overrides">Overrides</span></h2>
<p>There are a number of override variables on objects that will change the way the Treasure System functions. For each of these variables, a value less than 0 turns off that part of the system, a value of 0 ignores the override, and a value greater than 0 uses that value instead of the one on the creature. Each variable has a short explanation of what overriding does.
